WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.200 --> 01:50.540
THE DECIDING MOMENT

01:51.710 --> 01:52.670
Take this!

01:52.840 --> 01:54.210
Zapple!

02:07.100 --> 02:08.390
It worked!

02:10.810 --> 02:13.020
We did it! Hooray! Hooray!

02:14.230 --> 02:19.280
As expected, his armour's fine,
but I bet he's burned to a crisp in there.

02:20.820 --> 02:24.490
That's what you get
for underestimating us, right Dai?!

02:32.210 --> 02:33.090
Popp!

02:35.960 --> 02:38.800
Even Zapple didn't work?!

02:38.970 --> 02:41.220
No, it worked.

02:41.840 --> 02:45.810
But he withstood the damage from it!

02:46.220 --> 02:49.180
Even without his armour,
Hyunckel's strong!

02:50.190 --> 02:52.150
I misjudged you two.

02:52.310 --> 02:56.650
If you can do this,
then there's no need to hold back.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.400
Here goes!

03:00.650 --> 03:02.450
Dai, one more!

03:02.610 --> 03:05.120
Too late!
Dark Puppetry Aura Hand!

03:05.280 --> 03:06.330
Zap...

03:06.830 --> 03:08.500
That binding thing again!

03:10.660 --> 03:11.670
Farewell!

03:13.330 --> 03:15.750
Bloody Scryde!

03:18.510 --> 03:22.130
<i>We can't beat him.
Not by sword or by magic.</i>

03:24.140 --> 03:26.180
Dai!

03:29.430 --> 03:30.680
It's over.

03:35.400 --> 03:37.860
Yeah, it must be an exit!

03:39.150 --> 03:41.070
Hang in there, Dai!

03:41.400 --> 03:42.610
No...

03:42.780 --> 03:45.620
Answer me, Dai! Dai!

03:45.780 --> 03:49.700
Don't bother.
Bloody Scryde is a killing attack.

03:49.870 --> 03:51.080
He's finished.

03:51.250 --> 03:52.830
Shut up!

03:53.000 --> 03:58.710
This is all my fault! I got Dai killed!

03:59.880 --> 04:01.590
Join him in the afterlife.

04:02.130 --> 04:03.800
Wait, Hyunckel!

04:07.180 --> 04:08.850
When did you get out?!

04:09.180 --> 04:10.980
Hyunckel, how could you?!

04:11.520 --> 04:15.020
You've struck a fellow Disciple of Avan!

04:15.440 --> 04:19.900
Don't give me that.
He's a student of my father's killer!

04:20.030 --> 04:24.200
You're wrong!
Master Avan wasn't your father's killer!

04:24.360 --> 04:25.530
Spare me the lies!

04:25.700 --> 04:27.240
It's the truth!

04:28.160 --> 04:30.620
This was in a chest in a hidden room.

04:32.000 --> 04:32.830
This is...

04:33.460 --> 04:34.870
a Soul Shell!

04:35.500 --> 04:38.630
They contain messages from the dying!

04:39.290 --> 04:44.340
It's from your father.
The last words of the Hell Knight Bartos!

04:44.720 --> 04:47.640
Dad's last words?! Impossible!

04:47.800 --> 04:49.930
How could that exist?!

04:51.350 --> 04:52.930
This isn't happening.

04:53.390 --> 04:56.770
There's no way he's dead!

04:59.980 --> 05:01.150
He's alive!

05:05.900 --> 05:11.660
<i>In that instant, he leaned his body back
and avoided a hit to his heart!</i>

05:14.460 --> 05:16.790
We can't... beat him...

05:18.330 --> 05:22.000
<i>He can't be beaten by sword.
He can't be beaten by magic.</i>

05:22.800 --> 05:24.590
<i>Not by sword or by magic.</i>

05:24.760 --> 05:26.130
We can't beat him!

05:30.470 --> 05:31.600
Dai...

05:32.220 --> 05:36.350
Listen, Hyunckel,
to the truth your father left behind!

05:39.310 --> 05:42.940
What really happened
the day this Underground Palace fell!

05:43.940 --> 05:46.700
<i>Hyunckel... My son...</i>

05:47.070 --> 05:47.820
Dad?!

05:51.530 --> 05:54.330
<i>My dear son, Hyunckel.</i>

05:54.660 --> 06:00.210
<i>I leave this message
so that you will know the truth.</i>

06:00.830 --> 06:04.250
<i>The day the hero's party
attacked the Underground Palace,</i>

06:04.420 --> 06:08.220
<i>I fought Avan, the Hero
as keeper of the Hell Gate!</i>

06:09.470 --> 06:11.850
<i>But Avan was strong.</i>

06:20.020 --> 06:22.150
<i>I prepared for my death.</i>

06:22.480 --> 06:23.650
<i>And then...</i>

06:26.900 --> 06:29.150
What's wrong?! Strike me down!

06:29.820 --> 06:30.820
Let's not do this.

06:30.990 --> 06:34.080
What?! Will you shame me with your mercy?!

06:37.000 --> 06:40.330
That was clearly made by a child's hands.

06:40.500 --> 06:44.840
It seems unlikely, but you have a family.

06:46.090 --> 06:50.180
When I realized that, I couldn't kill you.

06:53.300 --> 06:57.600
You've beaten me. Not just in strength,
but in heart as well!

06:58.060 --> 07:00.520
Now please open the gate.

07:00.690 --> 07:03.900
The only one I'm here for is Hadlar.

07:05.150 --> 07:08.860
Sir Hero! I have something I must ask you!

07:10.490 --> 07:12.030
<i>And so I told him.</i>

07:12.410 --> 07:15.780
<i>How I found and raised a human child.</i>

07:16.290 --> 07:21.830
<i>And that, even if he spared me,
should Hadlar die, I would cease to be.</i>

07:22.580 --> 07:26.380
Hero Avan! Please look after my son!

07:26.550 --> 07:29.760
Raise him to be a strong,
righteous warrior!

07:29.920 --> 07:34.760
I ask that you show him real human warmth!

07:35.260 --> 07:36.180
Yes.

07:37.810 --> 07:41.190
<i>Sir Avan gracefully accepted.</i>

07:42.190 --> 07:46.020
<i>And then Sir Avan went to face Hadlar.</i>

07:51.030 --> 07:52.610
<i>Soon after...</i>

07:55.570 --> 07:58.830
<i>Hadlar's death cry
echoed through the palace!</i>

08:00.700 --> 08:04.210
<i>And yet... I still lived.</i>

08:12.300 --> 08:13.760
Lord Hadlar!

08:13.930 --> 08:15.680
You survived?!

08:15.840 --> 08:17.430
At my moment of death,

08:17.600 --> 08:21.480
I was saved by the dark powers
of the Underworld god, Vearn!

08:21.810 --> 08:24.230
The Underworld god, Vearn?!

08:24.400 --> 08:30.940
I must now sleep for 13 years to build up
my power and create a new Dark Army!

08:31.110 --> 08:35.570
An army far greater
than the current Dark Army!

08:35.950 --> 08:40.290
But, before I do that,
I need to execute you!

08:40.790 --> 08:42.160
M-Me?!

08:42.660 --> 08:45.120
You're an absolute failure!

08:45.290 --> 08:48.790
With your pathetic sense of justice
and chivalry!

08:48.960 --> 08:51.960
Your human-like warmth makes you weak!

08:52.510 --> 08:57.720
And on top of that, you let Avan
pass right through the Hell Gate!

08:58.180 --> 09:00.180
When I create my new Dark Army,

09:00.350 --> 09:04.810
it will have no place
for a mistake like you!

09:08.610 --> 09:12.570
Well, Avan, enjoy your moment of peace.

09:12.940 --> 09:17.360
When my new Dark Army is complete,
I'll come for you first!

09:19.950 --> 09:22.410
H-Hyunckel...

09:26.500 --> 09:27.620
Dad?!

09:29.500 --> 09:30.210
Dad!

09:35.220 --> 09:36.720
Hyunckel...

09:36.970 --> 09:41.010
<i>I no longer had the strength
to tell you the truth.</i>

09:41.350 --> 09:46.810
<i>And so I hid this message in secret
within this Soul Shell.</i>

09:47.140 --> 09:51.070
<i>Hoping that one day, you would hear it.</i>

09:53.530 --> 09:57.400
<i>Hyunckel, I hope that
you live like a human.</i>

09:57.570 --> 10:00.530
<i>And you must not hate Sir Avan!</i>

10:00.700 --> 10:06.750
<i>If anything, hate this foolish monster
who deemed to raise a human child.</i>

10:07.500 --> 10:10.000
<i>But know that I was happy.</i>

10:10.170 --> 10:16.880
<i>For a brief moment,
this cold corpse of a body felt warmth.</i>

10:17.420 --> 10:20.640
<i>Please let me say this one more time...</i>

10:21.550 --> 10:26.600
<i>Hyunckel... thank you for the memories...</i>

10:26.770 --> 10:28.730
<i>Dad!</i>

10:30.690 --> 10:34.860
Then Hadlar was the one
who killed my father?!

10:35.610 --> 10:41.370
And Avan knew I thought
he killed my father...

10:41.740 --> 10:44.620
and still looked after me?!

10:46.370 --> 10:47.250
Lies...

10:48.330 --> 10:50.040
All lies!

10:53.630 --> 10:55.880
Sword... and magic...

10:57.590 --> 10:59.090
H-Hey Dai?!

10:59.970 --> 11:02.300
Sword... and magic...

11:02.640 --> 11:04.180
Wait! Dai!

11:05.140 --> 11:08.770
<i>Something's wrong.
It's like he doesn't know who I am.</i>

11:09.060 --> 11:12.150
<i>Are you telling me
he's not even conscious?!</i>

11:13.270 --> 11:13.940
Dai?!

11:14.110 --> 11:18.440
Impossible! A direct hit
with Bloody Scryde and he still lives?!

11:24.990 --> 11:27.490
MAGIC BULLET GUN

11:30.000 --> 11:32.500
BLOODY SCRYDE

11:35.290 --> 11:38.260
<i>I remember Master Avan mentioning this.</i>

11:38.420 --> 11:44.930
<i>Sometimes martial artists can keep on
fighting even after being knocked out.</i>

11:45.680 --> 11:48.390
<i>Like their battle instincts keep on going.</i>

11:49.180 --> 11:51.690
<i>That must be what's happening with Dai!</i>

11:51.850 --> 11:55.440
Dai, don't! He'll kill you!

11:56.230 --> 11:59.440
Curse you.
I'll finish you for sure this time!

11:59.610 --> 12:03.240
Stop! You heard what your father said!

12:03.410 --> 12:07.330
The Dark Lord Hadlar is the one
you should really hate!

12:07.490 --> 12:09.290
Stop using your sword for evil!

12:09.450 --> 12:10.790
Enough!

12:12.670 --> 12:15.040
There's no turning back for me!

12:15.420 --> 12:18.050
I'm the Undead Legion Commander
of the Dark Army!

12:18.460 --> 12:24.590
With my body encased in this dark armour,
I am the vengeful warrior, Hyunckel!

12:25.760 --> 12:27.100
Hyunckel...

12:35.940 --> 12:37.190
Here goes, Dai!

12:45.660 --> 12:47.320
<i>Magic and sword...</i>

12:47.490 --> 12:50.040
It's no good!
He doesn't have his usual speed!

12:50.200 --> 12:51.160
This is the end!

12:51.330 --> 12:53.620
<i>Magic... and sword!</i>

12:55.540 --> 12:58.750
What?! My supreme armour!

12:59.880 --> 13:02.090
His sword burns?!

13:02.840 --> 13:04.970
That's the flame of a Frizz spell!

13:05.130 --> 13:07.930
<i>No one can encase a weapon in magic!</i>

13:08.550 --> 13:14.140
<i>If anyone could, they would have to be
something beyond human!</i>

13:24.490 --> 13:28.990
Yes! Dai was able to create
a new attack in this moment of peril!

13:29.160 --> 13:32.870
When neither magic
nor sword worked alone, he used both...

13:33.040 --> 13:34.330
in a Magic Sword!

13:34.500 --> 13:35.790
Curse you!

13:50.850 --> 13:52.260
Nice! Do it!

14:00.730 --> 14:01.360
Oh no!

14:03.650 --> 14:06.070
I won't miss this time!

14:06.490 --> 14:08.070
<i>I've gotta do something!</i>

14:09.530 --> 14:11.780
<i>The thunderclouds I summoned...!</i>

14:12.160 --> 14:16.710
Dai, the lightning!
Call down the lighting!

14:16.870 --> 14:19.290
Lightning...

14:19.460 --> 14:22.960
Give it up! I'll finish it with this!

14:23.130 --> 14:26.420
Lightning... Call lightning...

14:26.590 --> 14:28.260
Call down the lightning!

14:28.430 --> 14:32.100
Take this! Bloody Scryde!

14:36.020 --> 14:36.810
What?!

14:36.980 --> 14:39.060
Zap...

14:41.400 --> 14:43.690
Strash!

14:55.370 --> 14:57.000
He did it!

14:57.160 --> 15:01.460
<i>Incomplete or not, it's an Avan Strash
and Zapple double whammy!</i>

15:01.630 --> 15:04.340
<i>Not even Hyunckel can withstand...</i>

15:10.430 --> 15:12.430
<i>Is he immortal?!</i>

15:23.520 --> 15:25.770
We won! We won!

15:32.610 --> 15:34.740
<i>It's no good. I'm finished!</i>

15:35.080 --> 15:37.120
Dai, that's enough!

15:38.450 --> 15:39.710
Maam?!

15:40.040 --> 15:44.080
Dai, it's all over! You've won!

15:44.920 --> 15:50.130
Please... I don't want to see
the Disciples of Avan fighting each other.

15:53.180 --> 15:54.300
Tears?

16:07.570 --> 16:09.490
Maam? Hyunckel?!

16:09.860 --> 16:11.280
What was I doing?

16:11.450 --> 16:12.610
Dai...

16:13.070 --> 16:14.110
Why?

16:14.870 --> 16:16.660
I'm your enemy.

16:16.830 --> 16:18.540
You're not our enemy.

16:22.250 --> 16:23.710
That's my...

16:29.300 --> 16:32.050
You kept it this whole time?

16:32.220 --> 16:37.600
I knew that the time would come
when I would return this to you.

16:39.310 --> 16:43.600
<i>This kindness... This caring warmth...</i>

16:44.730 --> 16:46.060
<i>She's like...</i>

16:47.560 --> 16:49.270
<i>a holy mother.</i>

16:55.740 --> 16:57.830
Dai, are you okay?!

16:58.620 --> 17:02.040
Popp, Gomechan... Did I win?

17:02.200 --> 17:03.330
That's right.

17:03.500 --> 17:04.420
I...

17:05.040 --> 17:06.330
I lose.

17:06.500 --> 17:07.960
Hyunckel.

17:14.090 --> 17:18.510
What are you doing, Maam?!
What if he comes at us again?!

17:18.680 --> 17:20.890
There's no need to worry.

17:21.060 --> 17:23.930
And shouldn't I get healed first?

17:31.190 --> 17:32.570
I'm still casting Midheal!

17:32.740 --> 17:33.820
It's enough.

17:33.990 --> 17:39.580
Just look at you, Hyunckel!
Losing and then getting a lap pillow!

17:39.740 --> 17:42.160
It's so pathetic it's hilarious!

17:42.330 --> 17:45.120
You're.. Flazzard!

17:45.290 --> 17:49.380
That's right! The mightiest
of the Six Legion Commanders!

17:49.540 --> 17:52.500
Blizzblaze General Flazzard!

17:52.670 --> 17:56.300
What is that guy?!
He's fire and ice stuck together!

17:56.470 --> 17:58.220
What are you doing here?!

17:58.390 --> 18:04.180
Isn't it obvious?!
I thought I'd drop by and kill you!

18:05.850 --> 18:09.230
You know I've never liked you.

18:09.940 --> 18:15.280
A human trying to take all the credit?!
Never in a million years!

18:15.820 --> 18:20.240
If you'd won, I figured I'd kill you
and take the credit.

18:20.410 --> 18:23.450
But it's even better that you lost!

18:23.620 --> 18:29.420
I'll say you all killed each other
and spare you the shame!

18:30.330 --> 18:32.340
You can cry and thank me!

18:35.380 --> 18:36.130
What's this?!

18:37.800 --> 18:41.180
I just gave this extinct volcano
a little wake-up call!

18:41.350 --> 18:44.770
Soon this place'll be
overflowing with magma!

18:44.930 --> 18:45.930
What?!

18:51.020 --> 18:53.110
Curse you, Flazzard!

18:53.860 --> 18:57.280
Whoops! Looks like I ain't welcome!

18:57.610 --> 18:59.950
Guess I'll be bowing out now!

19:00.110 --> 19:00.990
Everybody!

19:01.660 --> 19:05.450
Enjoy your swim in the lava!

19:08.080 --> 19:09.920
It's no good! We can't escape!

19:10.370 --> 19:11.710
If we can make it up there...!

19:11.880 --> 19:14.040
Nobody has that kind of strength left!

19:30.560 --> 19:31.600
Hyunckel?!

19:31.770 --> 19:35.860
I can't let any of you die here!

19:36.940 --> 19:41.570
<i>Crocodine, I finally understand
how you felt!</i>

19:41.990 --> 19:45.410
<i>I hope I can apologize to you
in the afterlife.</i>

19:45.580 --> 19:48.790
<i>But for now, for just an instant...</i>

19:48.950 --> 19:53.000
<i>lend me your titan strength!</i>

19:56.750 --> 19:58.880
Stop! Don't do it, Hyunckel!

20:07.770 --> 20:08.810
Hyunckel!

20:09.350 --> 20:11.270
Hyunckel!

20:11.850 --> 20:15.860
<i>Thank you.
At long last, my eyes are finally open.</i>

20:16.440 --> 20:20.690
<i>I wish I could help you three out more...</i>

20:21.280 --> 20:24.030
<i>but it looks like this is as far as I go.</i>

20:25.660 --> 20:26.870
Hyunckel!

20:27.030 --> 20:29.240
Watch out! This place won't last!

20:29.410 --> 20:30.040
Maam!

20:30.200 --> 20:32.210
It's coming down! We've got to go!

20:32.370 --> 20:34.670
But Hyunckel's still...!

20:35.170 --> 20:38.380
<i>Farewell, Dai and Popp...</i>

20:39.710 --> 20:42.170
<i>Goodbye... Maam...</i>

20:43.010 --> 20:45.260
Hyunckel!

20:54.140 --> 20:56.730
And so the Undead Legion ends.

20:56.900 --> 21:02.570
Master Hyunckel, at least let this
humble Moruge guide you to the afterlife.

21:07.240 --> 21:10.040
I hear the Underground Palace
was destroyed.

21:10.540 --> 21:14.290
It seems that extinct volcano
suddenly erupted.

21:14.460 --> 21:16.580
<i>An extinct volcano erupting?</i>

21:18.040 --> 21:20.960
Huh. That a shame.

21:21.760 --> 21:23.840
Well, so be it.

21:24.010 --> 21:29.300
He took the new Hero out with him,
so I'd say that wasn't a bad job.

21:29.850 --> 21:31.390
<i>The audacity...</i>

21:35.560 --> 21:40.150
<i>How terrifying it is
to see a man starved for glory.</i>

21:40.570 --> 21:45.400
Okay! Now that Hyunckel's dead,
I guess conquering the Holkia continent

21:45.570 --> 21:47.410
is my job now!

21:48.950 --> 21:55.000
Of course, all I gotta do is find
little Princess Leona and kill her!

21:55.160 --> 21:58.210
Talk about an easy job!

22:20.150 --> 22:25.900
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.150 --> 22:25.900
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.910
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.910
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:36.120
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:36.120
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.420 --> 22:44.090
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.420 --> 22:44.090
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.250 --> 22:46.630
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.250 --> 22:46.630
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.800 --> 22:52.760
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.800 --> 22:52.760
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.220 --> 22:57.430
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.220 --> 22:57.430
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:01.650
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:01.650
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.810 --> 23:08.110
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.810 --> 23:08.110
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.950
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.950
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:19.250
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:19.250
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.140 --> 23:37.140
<i>Having defeated Hyunckel, Dai and company</i>

23:37.310 --> 23:41.810
<i>along with Baduck, meet Amy,
one of the Papnica Troika.</i>

23:42.150 --> 23:45.610
<i>Together, they head to Valge Island
where Leona awaits.</i>

23:45.770 --> 23:51.240
<i>But the island is already under siege by
their next enemy, the Blizzblaze Legion.</i>

23:52.360 --> 23:54.990
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:55.160 --> 23:57.620
<i>"Blizzblaze General Flazzard"</i>

23:57.790 --> 23:59.660
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

